				<pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2020 20:53:59 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>KaraKatt</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5950867</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k2vZP4nSXr4">Say something new</a></em></strong><br /> <strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k2vZP4nSXr4">I have nothing left</a></em></strong><br /> <strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k2vZP4nSXr4">I can't face the dark without you</a></em></strong><br /> <strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k2vZP4nSXr4">There's nothing left to lose</a></em></strong><br /> <strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k2vZP4nSXr4">The fighting never ends</a></em></strong><br /> <strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k2vZP4nSXr4">I can't face the dark without you</a></em></strong></p> </div> </blockquote> <blockquote> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qWR0Tm_OXm0">The story's undone</a></em></strong><br /> <strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qWR0Tm_OXm0">Unraveled at the seams</a></em></strong><br /> <strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qWR0Tm_OXm0">Don't wake me up</a></em></strong><br /> <strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qWR0Tm_OXm0">Death is misleading</a></em></strong><br /> <strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qWR0Tm_OXm0">And when I fall asleep, Sleep with a ghost</a></em></strong></p> </div> </blockquote> <p>Thank you for reading!</p> <p>This was the response of Rosa to the <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/hurt">previous tale.</a> It was another interesting one to write, but it gave a sort of ending to the situation. Well, sort of, it was a form of ending I guess.</p> <p>This is all a roundabout way of saying: I would love to thank my amazing critters: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6479803&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595729041" alt="HarryBlank" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6479803)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank" >HarryBlank</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hexick" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5065702&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595729041" alt="Hexick" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5065702)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hexick" >Hexick</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiifu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6394107&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595729041" alt="chiifu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6394107)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiifu" >chiifu</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/voidlady" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5366711&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595729041" alt="VoidLady" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5366711)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/voidlady" >VoidLady</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/marcelles-raynes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5722579&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595729041" alt="Marcelles_Raynes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5722579)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/marcelles-raynes" >Marcelles_Raynes</a></span></p> <p>Anyway, yada yada, songs that I couldn’t decide on so I put both. Whatever. I actually wrote this, got critique on it, and posted within 20 hours. Boom! New record, and probably my only record lol.</p> <p>I hope you enjoyed reading the tale! I love you all and I hope y'all have a wonderful day!</p> 
				 	]]>
